    "notes": [
      "Each row contains 6 glyph IDs rendered at 6 different grid positions",
      "Glyph IDs follow stride-57 pattern: val[n] = base + n*57",
      "Position function at 0x001C1DC0 maps column index to screen coordinates",
      "The katakana_mapping.json labels all 6 stride-57 values as the same character",
      "but analysis of the rendering code confirms they are 6 DIFFERENT characters",
      "displayed at 6 different screen positions (columns)",
      "Code switch cases: 0-6 = rows 0-6, 7 = rows 7-8, A = rows 9-11, extras = rows 12-14"
    ]
